    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017630/extras/20842855fd22b73d712e748411e15810.avif?t=1755535048\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your son, Al, has been diagnosed with a terminal illness. There is a cure, but you'll need to venture into the mysterious country of Lutherwyn to find clues about it. Your wife went ahead to search but mysteriously disappeared. Now, it's your turn to save your family. Use your sword skills in the magical land of Lutherwyn and rescue your loved ones.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017630/extras/69bc9159869f4abe782b8c30831ba817.avif?t=1755535048\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a card-battling deck-builder game. Win fights to earn money, and use it to buy equipment, buffs, unlock events, or improve your deck. Battle enemies in the arena and work your way to the top rank to win the cure. Face aggressive and seductive women who will use their charm and dominating tactics to throw you off your game. Be prepared!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017630/extras/eb8dd8c9ba576f849028f027704eaf6b.avif?t=1755535048\" width=616 height=150 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017630/extras/b1c22ef62c84934a0a23eaace6de3949.avif?t=1755535048\" width=616 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017630/extras/b52af0a5b1e32309f14851e3d9caa6d4.avif?t=1755535048\" width=616 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017630/extras/bf0c4c27247b9f25c04335a0f159ff03.avif?t=1755535048\" width=616 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017630/extras/ebba1eeedfaa95926163e92d050db0f0.avif?t=1755535048\" width=616 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017630/extras/0ce45a3ca961198d27d6d17c3c85e201.avif?t=1755535048\" width=616 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017630/extras/c1f49176dbf22be850c650939e6f29e5.avif?t=1755535048\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time and money are of the essence! You only have six months to find the cure to save your son and rescue your missing wife. Use funds wisely to buy equipment or booster packs that might strengthen your deck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gallery and Battle Recollection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive your adventures and misencounters in the Gallery. This includes CG, H-scenes, and music. Note that both victory and loss scenes are unlocked, so there\u2019s no need to intentionally lose (remember, time is of the essence!). The game also features a free-battle mode that allows you to fight previously encountered enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers multiple endings based on the choices you make and match results during gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Carry Over</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When certain conditions are met, losing the game unlocks a carry-over feature. This lets you choose what to retain in your next save file\u2014or start fresh. Carry-over options may include skill cards, stats, equipment, and even money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017630/extras/20842855fd22b73d712e748411e15810.avif?t=1755535048\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your son, Al, has been diagnosed with a terminal illness. There is a cure, but you'll need to venture into the mysterious country of Lutherwyn to find clues about it. Your wife went ahead to search but mysteriously disappeared. Now, it's your turn to save your family. Use your sword skills in the magical land of Lutherwyn and rescue your loved ones.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017630/extras/69bc9159869f4abe782b8c30831ba817.avif?t=1755535048\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a card-battling deck-builder game. Win fights to earn money, and use it to buy equipment, buffs, unlock events, or improve your deck. Battle enemies in the arena and work your way to the top rank to win the cure. Face aggressive and seductive women who will use their charm and dominating tactics to throw you off your game. Be prepared!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017630/extras/eb8dd8c9ba576f849028f027704eaf6b.avif?t=1755535048\" width=616 height=150 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017630/extras/b1c22ef62c84934a0a23eaace6de3949.avif?t=1755535048\" width=616 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017630/extras/b52af0a5b1e32309f14851e3d9caa6d4.avif?t=1755535048\" width=616 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017630/extras/bf0c4c27247b9f25c04335a0f159ff03.avif?t=1755535048\" width=616 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017630/extras/ebba1eeedfaa95926163e92d050db0f0.avif?t=1755535048\" width=616 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017630/extras/0ce45a3ca961198d27d6d17c3c85e201.avif?t=1755535048\" width=616 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017630/extras/c1f49176dbf22be850c650939e6f29e5.avif?t=1755535048\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time and money are of the essence! You only have six months to find the cure to save your son and rescue your missing wife. Use funds wisely to buy equipment or booster packs that might strengthen your deck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gallery and Battle Recollection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive your adventures and misencounters in the Gallery. This includes CG, H-scenes, and music. Note that both victory and loss scenes are unlocked, so there\u2019s no need to intentionally lose (remember, time is of the essence!). The game also features a free-battle mode that allows you to fight previously encountered enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers multiple endings based on the choices you make and match results during gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Carry Over</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When certain conditions are met, losing the game unlocks a carry-over feature. This lets you choose what to retain in your next save file\u2014or start fresh. Carry-over options may include skill cards, stats, equipment, and even money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
